Dominic_1_1_0                   Dominic_1_1_0                   The Prince requires your presence at a very important event. A Conclave is to be held here, and the services of the city's Kindred are needed to ensure that the meeting proceeds without...interruption. The Ventrue Justicar Lucinde and the Primogen themselves will be in attendance. You'll be working security for this event, watching after the Primogen. You're job is to ensure that they have a safe and pleasant visit.
Player_1_1_2                    Player_1_1_2                    Will we receive compensation for our duties?
Player_1_1_1                    Player_1_1_1                    We will do as our Prince wishes.
Player_1_1_6                    Player_1_1_6                    What is the purpose of the Conclave? We've heard of disputes to the Prince's position...
Player_1_1_4                    Player_1_1_4                    We'd like to speak with the Prince about this matter.
Dominic_1_1_3                   Dominic_1_1_3                   (raises an eyebrow) You will receive the satisfaction of serving your Prince! (calms down) And I should suppose that rubbing elbows with the movers and shakers of this domain should be of some benefit to you.
Dominic_1_1_5                   Dominic_1_1_5                   The Prince has no time to deal with such matters - or haven't you noticed the slavering hordes of Sabbat at our borders? Or is it that you lack trust in your Seneschal? (grins) Hmm, perhaps you'll go far in the Camarilla, young ones. Be assured that the Prince is well aware of this need, and has seen to me to provide him with suitable subjects. I'd be honored by the request, if I were in your position.
Dominic_1_1_7                   Dominic_1_1_7                   Ah, I see the city's rumor mill never ceases to function. You'll most certainly hear more of the events during the Conclave. You may learn a thing or two, but know this now - there will always be those envying the power one attains. It serves a Prince well to keep his friends near and enemies even closer. I'm confident this meeting shall have a just resolution, ensuring the rightful Prince this domain.
Dominic_1_1_8                   Dominic_1_1_8                   (notices a speck upon the desk, and begins furiously rubbing it with his index finger) I've spent enough time with you. You understand your duties? Good, there is no room for mistakes, if I were you I'd make sure I keep my eyes open, fangs sheathed, and lips puckered. (gesturing towards Bill) Mr. Campbell heads security for the Prince, and will show you your quarters for the event. Mirabilis arrives tomorrow evening, we will greet our guests in the lobby at 10pm, sharp.
Bill_1_1_9                      Bill_1_1_9                      Each suite is protected by electronic security and are separated by titanium bulkheads, absolutely impenetrable. Use this card to enter your suite during the day.
Bill_1_1_10                     Bill_1_1_10                     Make sure you have fed well before the event. There's no telling how long the Conclave will last, don't be surprised if you're forced to sip outta bloodbags for a few...
Kazi_10_1_103                   Kazi_10_1_103                   The Sabbat do not appreciate such betrayal, be sure that retribution will be sure and swift. But the word of the ghoul offers us no proof. If we could recover the pact we made with the Seneschal, we would be able to consider our contract cancelled.
Smashface_11_1_104              Smashface_11_1_104              Many thanks. I'm Smashface, childe to Mr. Schreck. The Seneschal took me as ransom, forcing my sire to agree to support him, should he become Prince. The bastard has been torturing me here for days, I can never forgive Schreck for not trying to free me.
Player_11_1_105                 Player_11_1_105                 Why didn't he come to save you?
Smashface_11_1_106              Smashface_11_1_106              Well....Dominic has something else on my sire. The Nosferatu maintain control of the sewers within the city. We also have many secret entrances to 'secure' areas, including the Prince's offices. Dominic discovered this fact, and threatened to disclose this to the Prince.
Bill_12_1_113                   Bill_12_1_113                   You've made it! Lucinde has arrived and the Conclave is about to begin. I'm going to plant the ring in Michaela's gown.
Player_12_1_114                 Player_12_1_114                 Good. Make sure she won't be able to detect the ring.
Player_12_1_115                 Player_12_1_115                 No, don't plant the ring. We haven't found any information on Dominic. We'll need to leave town, you should too. You're in danger if you stay.
Bill_12_1_156                   Bill_12_1_156                   Yeah, you're probably right. Let's get outta here. What a freakin' mess...
Kazi_12_1_107                   Kazi_12_1_107                   Have you found the pact we made with the Seneschal?
Player_12_1_109                 Player_12_1_109                 Yes, here it is.
Player_12_1_108                 Player_12_1_108                 No, he seems to have hidden it.
Kazi_12_1_110                   Kazi_12_1_110                   Excellent work, fledglings. Of course, it serves no purpose to stop what has been set in motion, the evening's events will go as planned, up to a point. Before the incursion, Dominic will find his puny force destroyed, and with the domain's rule in disarray, we shall be able to stroll into the area
Player_12_1_111                 Player_12_1_111                 And what of your promise to help clear our names?
Kazi_12_1_112                   Kazi_12_1_112                   Don't worry, young ones, your names will be renewed, during your rebirth as Sabbat!
Johnston_13_1_127               Johnston_13_1_127               (picking up the ring, astonished): It is Mirabilis' ring! Each Regent's sigil is unique!
Lucinde_13_1_128                Lucinde_13_1_128                Michaela, this proof has implicated you in the murder of the Regent. You are hereby removed of your position. By Camarilla law, your Seneschal is the Prince.
Michaela_13_1_129               Michaela_13_1_129               No! The blood is on Dominic's hands as well!
Dominic_13_1_130                Dominic_13_1_130                Excellent! I do believe I have the support of the Primogen?
Arianna_13_1_131                Arianna_13_1_131                Of course! You'll make an excellent Prince!
Dominic_13_1_132                Dominic_13_1_132                (taking the players aside) Well, my new friends. I see that I have grossly underestimated your abilities. I know of your meetings with the... sisters, and hope you understand that I will never give this domain over to the Sabbat. It was never my intention. We'll deal them a fatal blow tonight. In the meantime, I may have need of creatures of your talents in my new organization. Of course, first, you'll need to clean up a bit. Schreck's tunnel may be useful, but there are distinct disadvantages to its use. Come, let's greet our old Sabbat friends, shall we?
Johnston_13_1_144               Johnston_13_1_144               (picking up the ring, astonished): It is Mirabilis' ring! Each Regent's sigil is unique!
Lucinde_13_1_145                Lucinde_13_1_145                Michaela, this proof has implicated you in the murder of the Regent. You are hereby removed of your position. By Camarilla law, your Seneschal is the Prince.
Michaela_13_1_146               Michaela_13_1_146               No! The blood is on Dominic's hands as well!
Player_13_1_147                 Player_13_1_147                 ... (say nothing)
Player_13_1_148                 Player_13_1_148                 We have proof of this. A pact with the Sabbat, signed in blood. Dominic's treachery is even greater, as he planned to place the domain into their hands.
Johnston_13_1_149               Johnston_13_1_149               (works Tremere Taste For Blood ritual) This blood is from the Seneschal!
Dominic_13_1_150                Dominic_13_1_150                No! No! The floor is so dirty! Oof!
HeavyG_13_1_151                 HeavyG_13_1_151                 That's for little-T...
Lucinde_13_1_152                Lucinde_13_1_152                It appears we have need of a new Prince. I would ask that Mr. Schreck step from the shadows to rule the Five Boroughs...if there are no objections? (glares at Arianna). Fine. Mr. Schreck, I would assume your first duties would be to counter the plans that these young Kindred have exposed.
Shreck_13_1_153                 Shreck_13_1_153                 Yes, Lucinde. (pulls party aside) Congratulations on your astounding victory. Relish this, as most times those in power are not so easy to defeat. And why should I allow Kindred with such a taste for toppling Princes survive within my domain?
Player_13_1_154                 Player_13_1_154                 We have met your childe, Smashface, and know of your knowledge of Dominic's plans to depose the Prince. The Nosferatu was full of information, how do you think we entered the offices?
Shreck_13_1_155                 Shreck_13_1_155                 Ah. Well, it seems that we have a Sabbat incursion to thwart. And I will need Kindred I can trust to lead the assault. (turns to the Primogen) I declare these Kindred free of the Blood Hunt, make this command known throughout the domain! Primogen of New York, rally your forces, tonight we deal the Sabbat a fatal blow!
Player_13_1_133                 Player_13_1_133                 The proof is here. The Seneschal intended to plant this ring on the Prince's person and falsely accuse her of the death.
Johnston_13_1_134               Johnston_13_1_134               (picking up the ring, astonished): It is Mirabilis' ring! Each Regent's sigil is unique!
Lucinde_13_1_135                Lucinde_13_1_135                What proof do you have of this?
Player_13_1_136                 Player_13_1_136                 This proves Dominic's treachery. A pact with the Sabbat, signed in blood. He planned to depose the Prince and then hand the domain over to the Sabbat.
Johnston_13_1_137               Johnston_13_1_137               (works Tremere Taste For Blood ritual) This blood is from the Seneschal!
Dominic_13_1_138                Dominic_13_1_138                No! No! The floor is so dirty! Oof!
HeavyG_13_1_139                 HeavyG_13_1_139                 That's for little-T...
Lucinde_13_1_140                Lucinde_13_1_140                Well, as long as there are no objections to Michaela retaining her title, this Conclave is concluded.
Michaela_13_1_141               Michaela_13_1_141               (pulls players aside) You have done well, for ones so young. What else have you discovered in the last few nights, I wonder?
Player_13_1_142                 Player_13_1_142                 We know of a planned Sabbat incursion, and a meeting with the Seneschal's handlers this evening.
Michaela_13_1_143               Michaela_13_1_143               Interesting. You have earned the right to remain within my territory, although I will be watching you. (Turns to the assembly) Make it known that the Blood Hunt for these Kindred is withdrawn. Primogen, amass our forces, tonight we rejoin to deal the Sabbat a fatal blow!
Dominic_13_1_116                Dominic_13_1_116                ..however, new information has come to our..what?!! You're supposed to be...
Johnston_13_1_117               Johnston_13_1_117               The assassins! Kill them!
Dominic_13_1_118                Dominic_13_1_118                (in unison) Yes! Kill them!
Arianna_13_1_119                Arianna_13_1_119                (in unison) Yes! Kill them!
Lucinde_13_1_120                Lucinde_13_1_120                Stop at once! Hold, or face the punishment of the Inner Circle!
Lucinde_13_1_121                Lucinde_13_1_121                You obviously have something to present to this meeting? I will hear you out, first though, I would like the Seneschal to continue. He appeared to be about to mention something important?
Dominic_13_1_122                Dominic_13_1_122                (shaky, looking at party) Ah.. yes. (Turns to Lucinde) As I was saying..new information has come to our attention. I regret to bring this forward, but I now have cause to believe that our own Prince was involved in the Regent's murder...
Michaela_13_1_123               Michaela_13_1_123               What!? You treacherous snake!
Arianna_13_1_124                Arianna_13_1_124                I knew it! Lies are never hidden to the Toreador!
Lucinde_13_1_125                Lucinde_13_1_125                Silence! Dominic, do you have proof for these accusations?
Michaela_13_1_126               Michaela_13_1_126               He has no proof! Lunatic wretch!
Arianna_2_1_14                  Arianna_2_1_14                  (grandiose) Well, we have arrived!
Dominic_2_1_15                  Dominic_2_1_15                  Welcome, Arianna!
Dominic_2_1_16                  Dominic_2_1_16                  I trust that you'll enjoy your stay in our modest haven...
Arianna_2_1_17                  Arianna_2_1_17                  (looking about the lobby) Tsk tsk. A shame that Michaela doesn't take my advice, with a Toreador's touch, this drab little hotel could be fabulous! Still, she's never been known to utilize potential, or even consider what our Clan has done for the Arts in this city. A shame.
Traci_2_1_18                    Traci_2_1_18                    What's up her ass?  Damn Toreador snobs. Who do they think's protectin' their precious museums from getting torched by the Black Hand? It's our blood out there on the streets! Brujah blood!
Player_2_1_19                   Player_2_1_19                   Things could be better. I heard what happened to Hector. Damn shame...
HeavyG_2_1_20                   HeavyG_2_1_20                   (grown stern) Yeah, it was. What this town needs is for Killa-B to come back and lay the smack down...hard. He's the OG, know what I'm sayin'?
Bill_2_1_11                     Bill_2_1_11                     Each Primogen has been assigned a suite. I will greet them and see them to their suites. Keep an eye on the area, the Sabbat could be anywhere, at least this is where I'd be if I were one of 'em. Stay out of trouble.
HeavyG_2_1_12                   HeavyG_2_1_12                   Alright, we ready to do this? (gestures to Bill) Cool, how's it going B?
Traci_2_1_13                    Traci_2_1_13                    (looking around) Ooh, pretty classy joint...
Mirabilis_2_1_21                Mirabilis_2_1_21                (nodding to empty space near the party) Greetings, Mr. Schreck.
Bill_2_1_22                     Bill_2_1_22                     Mr. Schreck, Regent Mirabilis, glad you could join us.
Johnston_2_1_23                 Johnston_2_1_23                 The defense of this region requires much of the Regent's focus, but we are pleased to finally see response from the Camarilla to our claims. It is long overdue. (looking around) We desire to retire to our suite immediately.
Bill_2_1_24                     Bill_2_1_24                     Very well then. Mr. Schreck, should we expect the arrival of your aide?
Shreck_2_1_25                   Shreck_2_1_25                   No...I have come alone.
Bill_2_1_26                     Bill_2_1_26                     Ok, let me show you...
Shreck_2_1_27                   Shreck_2_1_27                   (cutting him off with a raising of his gnarled hand) I will show myself to my quarters, thank you.
Michaela_3_1_28                 Michaela_3_1_28                 First, I would like to thank all of those here for attending this Conclave, and hope that it will serve to resolve the problems that assail our region in these tenuous times.
HeavyG_3_1_29                   HeavyG_3_1_29                   Enough with the pleasantries, Michaela, where's Lucinde? She's the one who called this little get-together in the first place...
Michaela_3_1_30                 Michaela_3_1_30                 I regret to inform you all that Lucinde has been detained with other... pressing matters in San Francisco, and it is questionable whether she will be appearing. I have been instructed to go forth with the Conclave, in hopes that we can resolve these matters amongst ourselves. Lucinde will arrive as soon as she is able.
Johnston_3_1_31                 Johnston_3_1_31                 This is outrageous! Mirabilis is the rightful Prince to this region, the only one willing to strike against the Sabbat instead of waiting pathetically for each new attack! He is also eldest of the Primogen. If we cannot state our cause before the Justicar, there can be no resolution!
Arianna_3_1_32                  Arianna_3_1_32                  (smiling curtly): It would seem we're all dressed up with no where to go.
Johnston_3_1_33                 Johnston_3_1_33                 Perhaps the Inner Circle doesn't see the importance of this matter? Do they not realize that without Tremere support, their feeble hold on the Five Boroughs would crumble in a night?!
HeavyG_3_1_34                   HeavyG_3_1_34                   There's plenty of Brujah blood on the streets, warlock! We don't hide in some ivory tower, my boys are out every night, laying it on the line!
Johnston_3_1_35                 Johnston_3_1_35                 The Black Hand has weaponry far more dangerous than the guns used by their street rabble! But then, I don't think I need to remind you of that - your artillery didn't forestall your recent loss in Queens, did it?
Mirabilis_3_1_36                Mirabilis_3_1_36                (holding up a hand to halt his childe): I see no reason to continue this Conclave without Lucinde's presence. We have already failed in our attempt to resolve this matter ourselves, as logic is met with the unyielding wall presented by this Prince. We await the arrival of the Justicar, should she be forthcoming.
Mirabilis_3_1_37                Mirabilis_3_1_37                (whispers to Johnston) Return to the chantry at once. Give word to the counsel that I request a formal complaint to the Inner Circle on this matter.
Arianna_3_1_38                  Arianna_3_1_38                  How can do they expect us to take their claim seriously, when they are unable to even engage in polite conversation?
Michaela_3_1_39                 Michaela_3_1_39                 (eyeing Arianna) We'll adjourn until tomorrow evening. I would remind our guests of the restriction on feeding within the bounds of the hotel, especially the mortal employees. I would direct you to the southern territory, or, if you prefer, suitable vessels can be delivered to your suites.
