Traci_4_1_47                    Traci_4_1_47                    Who's that? Anyone else up for a late night snack?
Michaela_5_1_48                 Michaela_5_1_48                 As you all are aware by now, there was a breach of security during the day, and Mirabilis is missing. The state of his suite seems to indicate sign of struggle, perhaps even that he has met final death.
Dominic_5_1_49                  Dominic_5_1_49                  Signs of struggle? It's awash in his blood, it's doubtful he's alive! (at the description of the room, Dominic grows noticeably irritated)
Shreck_5_1_50                   Shreck_5_1_50                   I have further news. Remains of his clothing and...jewelry were found washed up on Sheepshead bay this evening. They have been forwarded to the Barnard College chantry for examination.
