Luke_6_1_71                     Luke_6_1_71                     'Caus the Justicar is comin'. I think Dominic wants to get her in trouble. I think he killed those two yesterday. I don't think you killed 'em. You have to help me, if anything happens to Michaela, I'll.. I'll...I don't know what. Ya know?
