Dominic_7_1_78                  Dominic_7_1_78                  Indeed, I have. Since Michaela's spurned ghoul has come under my power, I have all the security I need. It was he who, under her instruction, allowed your agents into the haven for their work. Such treachery, all for the promise of the Embrace, which Michaela refuses him. Everything is working as planned.
Kazi_7_1_79                     Kazi_7_1_79                     Is it? We've received word that the whelps have escaped.
