Kazi_7_1_85                     Kazi_7_1_85                     We look forward to your success at tomorrow's Conclave. The plans for the initial occupation have not changed?
Dominic_7_1_86                  Dominic_7_1_86                  No, everything will go as planned. Until we meet again, hopefully within cleaner accommodations... (bows and exits, ducking low to avoid a bit of cobweb).
