Kazi_8_1_92                     Kazi_8_1_92                     Please accept our offer of 'safe haven', as it were. Above this building is an apartment that can be used as shelter during the day. You can access it via the ladder in the nearby alleyway. If you find proof of Dominic's betrayal, it will be useful to us as well as to you, for it would clear your involvement in the murder. It seems that, for a time, we are to be allied on a common goal. If you find proof of Dominic's betrayal, we will help to clear your name with the Camarilla. After all, what choice do you have? (smiles)
